654 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\042There\031s probably three different ways we can think about how tools get employed\056\056\056 We don\047t do that \133strategic raw data use\135 very often\056\056\056 The second area is as a creative partner\056\056\056 that\031s an area we use generative AI quite a bit\056\042\n\n\055 Tim)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 655 0 R
