  << /ActualText (\042\133AI is good\135 from a research and diligence perspective\056\056\056 but the practicality of understanding the realities of the business and capabilities and the way resources are deployed\054 and strategy of the company at a single point in time\054 like that\047s impossible to layer\054 and that is just like knowledge and experience\054 and so can\047t ever fully replace it\056\042\n\n\055 Akhil)
